# OpenAI Responses calls use the real codec and deterministic twin transcripts.

```console
$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-rich lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream --system 'Be concise' --attachment https://example.com/image.png --attachment-type document.pdf application/pdf --schema 'answer, score int' --schema-name result --max-output-tokens 64 --temperature 0.2 --top-p 0.9 --reasoning-effort high --speed fast --stop END --cache-key stable --metadata trace=yes --option store=true 'OpenAI rich request'
{"answer":"ready","score":7}

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-complete lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream 'OpenAI complete transcript'
Hello there.

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-stream lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture 'OpenAI stream transcript'
Looking that up.

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-tools lllm --catalog catalog.toml probe -m openai/fixture --tools
passed openai/fixture · 60 input · 6 output · [..]

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-refusal lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream 'OpenAI refusal'
? 1
error: content_filter: provider openai refused the request: not allowed route=openai/fixture provider=openai code=refusal

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-malformed lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream 'OpenAI malformed response'
? 1
error: response_decode: provider openai returned a 200 body without a Responses output array route=openai/fixture provider=openai

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-invalid-json-bytes lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream 'OpenAI invalid JSON bytes'
? 1
error: response_decode: provider openai returned invalid JSON route=openai/fixture provider=openai
  caused by: error decoding response body for url (http://127.0.0.1:3931/v1/responses)
  caused by: expected value at line 1 column 1

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-invalid-utf8-stream lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture 'OpenAI invalid UTF-8 stream'
? 1
error: stream_decode: an SSE frame was not UTF-8 route=openai/fixture
  caused by: invalid utf-8 sequence of 1 bytes from index 6

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-stream-body-failure lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture 'OpenAI stream body failure'
? 1
error: network: reading the provider response stream failed route=openai/fixture provider=openai
  caused by: error decoding response body
  caused by: error reading a body from connection
  caused by: unexpected EOF during chunk size line

$ OPENAI_API_KEY=oai-audio lllm --catalog catalog.toml -m openai/fixture --no-stream --attachment-type audio.wav audio/wav 'OpenAI audio input'
? 2
error: invalid_request: provider openai does not support audio content route=openai/fixture provider=openai code=unsupported_capability

```
